Nemotron3Diarization (VoxStudio vendored module)

Inference, DSP, and speaker-cache update code extracted and adapted from
soniqo/speech-swift v0.0.28, commit 231f8eb9f0971fee335fef49f42d2975e4fbf8bc,
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

VoxStudio changes:
- MLX INT8 backend only; Core ML, Sortformer and Community-1 code paths removed.
- Mel front end aligned with the source checkpoint's feature extractor
  (0.97 pre-emphasis, zero-padded centered STFT, unscaled power spectrum).
- Chunk-local mel extraction so long recordings never materialize a full spectrogram.
- Head input rows past the valid length are zeroed before the sub-pixel convolution.

The model weights are not part of this module. They are NVIDIA Nemotron 3
Diarization weights distributed under OpenMDW 1.1 and are downloaded at runtime.
